  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CBTF South Sudan 2010-2014 - CBTF 2010-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CBTF South Sudan 2010-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Capacity Building Trust Fund (CBTF) &#xe4;r en samfinansieringsmekanism    som st&#xf6;djer kapacitetsutveckling av statsf&#xf6;rvaltningen i S&#xf6;dra Sudan. Joint Donor Team (JDT) &#xe4;r fondens sekretariat, administrationen sk&#xf6;ts av privat kontrakt&#xf6;r. F&#xf6;rutom Sverige bidrar Kanada, Nederl&#xe4;nderna,   Norge och DfID till CBTF. S&#xf6;dra Sudans regering &#xe4;r ordf&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;r     CBTFs styrelse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Capacity Building Trust Fund (CBTF) is a multi-donor funding      mechanism for the capacity development of the South Sudanese civil    service. The Joint Donor Team (JDT) is the Secretariat and the        administration of the fund is handled by a private contractor.        Canada, Netherlands, Norway and UK contributes to the fund apart from  Sweden. The Government of South Sudan is chair of the board.</narrative>
  </description>
